@startuml

participant MetadataService as mds
participant CoreServices as cs
participant GracenoteService as gn
participant ConRadClient as cc

activate mds
activate gn
activate cs
activate cc

mds -> cs: registerServiceListClient(clientId, callback) **[1]**

cs -> mds: registerServiceListClient ack **[2]**

opt no apn status change
    cs -> mds: updateServiceList(List<ServiceListEntry> entries) **[3]**
    mds -> mds: evaluate **apn** value change **[4]**
else apn status change
    cs -> mds: updateServiceList(List<ServiceListEntry> entries) **[5]**
    mds -> mds: evaluate **apn** value change **[5]**
    mds -> gn: apnStatusChanged(data) **[7]**
    mds -> cc: apnStatutsChanged(data) **[8]**
end

@enduml